# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

node_modules
# `dist*`, not `dist`: a parked copy of a build (dist-main, dist-before) is what
# a payload measurement is made of, and Tailwind's scan is filesystem-based — one
# sitting here moved the eager stylesheet by 1.6 kB with no source change at all,
# which invalidated a whole round of numbers (#122 review).
dist*
*.local

# Build input, not source: fetched by scripts/fetch-java-compiler.mjs
public/java-compiler.jar

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.sw?
